1. d4 { [%csl Gd4][%cal Gd4e5] } 1... d5 { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gd5e4] } 2. c4 { That's the Queen's Gambit. White offers a temporary sacrifice in exchange for a control of the center. } 2... c6 { That's the Slav Defense. We support our Pawn with another Pawn, without blocking our light-square Bishop. } { [%cal Gc6d5,Gc8f5] } *


